<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιμάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιλύ̄π-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wipe all round</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὠφθαλμὼ τούτῳ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σύκῳ</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				132
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀδόντας ὀθονίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.976b
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπόγγῳ τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					8.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.840
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.28
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιμάξασθαι τὸν κόλπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.61
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.29.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wipe off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀκαθαρσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.94
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>purify by magic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				530.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.316
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.168d
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
